                                "sense_id": "8e591134-008f-3938-b954-32daee2b9577",
                                "text": "For not only did he find it piteous; but unseemly, unpermissible somehow, yet marvellously sweet, startling him out of all preconceived light diplomatic plans, plucking shrewdly at his complacently unawakened heart."
